rews\nMix: Kahl Henderson\nColourist: Jon Bruce @bsquaredpost\nAssistant Editor: Noora Lappalainen\n\nCasting by Des Hamilton Casting\n\nProduction Design: Urtė Rusteikaitė\nCostume Design: Kirstin Rodger\n\nSound Recordist: Marco Biaginin\nScript Supervisor: Nicola Docherty\n\n1st AD: Joel Hewett\n3rd AD: Heath Virgoe\nRunner: Ross McNicoll\nProduction Trainee: Layla Donnelly\n\n1st AC: Lara Abrami\n2nd AC: Jack Pass, Connor Wilson\nGaffer: Tyler Hay\nSpark: Vasileios Kapnis\nCamera Trainee: Daryna Pylypenko\n\nFight Director: Paul Donnelly\nHMU: Jolanta Eliza Jawor\nTrainee: Rory Kavanagh\n\nDriver: Reece Andrews\nStills: Ciaran Pasi and Kieran Smyth\n\nPost supervisor Courtney Welsh\nPost Sound Producers: Jay Newton, Drew Gibson\nAdditional Score: Kerr Darling\n\nPoster: Luca Pusceddu\n\nKit: Progressive, No Drama"}],"moreinfo":[{"link":"https://www.imdb.com/title/tt43607204/","outlink":{"svg":"<svg class=\"imdb-logo\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 -20 2100 1080\" xml:space=\"preserve\"><title>Open IMDb page</title><path class=\"st0\" d=\"M1981.7 0H120.1C53.9 0 0 53.9 0 120.2v788.4c0 66.3 53.9 120.2 120.1 120.2h1861.6c66.2 0 120.1-53.9 120.1-120.2V120.2c0-66.3-53.9-120.2-120.1-120.2m0 21.3c54.7 0 98.8 44.2 98.8 98.9v788.4c0 54.7-44.2 98.9-98.8 98.9H120.1c-54.6 0-98.8-44.2-98.8-98.9V120.2c0-54.7 44.2-98.9 98.8-98.9z\"/><path class=\"st0\" d=\"M302.6 217.9h155.5v600H302.6zm487.5 0-36 280.4L732 345.8c-6.7-48.9-12.8-91.6-18.9-128H511.3v600h136.3l.6-396.1 57.3 396.1h97.1L857.3 413l.3 404.8h136v-600H790.1zm446.8 108.2c6.1 3.5 10.2 9 11.9 16.9 1.7 7.6 2.6 25 2.6 52.1v232.4c0 40.2-2.6 64.6-7.9 73.6-5.2 9-18.9 13.3-41.3 13.3V320.6c17 0 28.6 1.7 34.7 5.5m-1.4 491.8c37.2 0 65.1-2 83.7-6.1 18.3-4.1 34-11 46.5-21.5 12.5-10.2 21.5-24.4 26.5-42.5 5.2-18 8.1-54.1 8.1-107.9V429.3c0-56.7-2.3-94.8-5.5-114.3-3.5-19.2-12.2-37-26.2-52.6-13.7-15.7-34-27.1-60.5-34-26.5-7-70.1-10.5-145.3-10.5h-116v600zm420.3-145.4c0 28.8-1.5 47.4-4.4 54.9-2.9 7.6-15.4 11.3-25 11.3-9.3 